<section class="sub-hero"><div class="sub-hero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="shell sub-hero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><span aria-current="page">Calculators</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Insurance Claim Calculators for Utah Owners</h1><p class="lede">Seven calculators and planners built around real appraisal questions. Check the insurer’s math and plan next steps. No sign-up, and nothing is stored.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="shell"><div class="tool-grid" data-stagger><a class="tool-card rv" href="/utah-claim-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/"><span class="tool-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tool-ic">Δ</span></span><span class="tool-b"><small>Estimator</small><h2 class="h3">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</h2><p>Size the dispute, test where an award could land and subtract appraiser and umpire fees to see your net.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/utah-claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="tool-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/documents.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/documents-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/documents.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="960" height="601" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tool-ic">ACV</span></span><span class="tool-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2 class="h3">RCV to ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><p>List damaged items by age and life expectancy to see the first check, the depreciation held back and the total.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/utah-claim-calculators/roof-pitch-squares-estimator/"><span class="tool-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tool-ic">▲</span></span><span class="tool-b"><small>Estimator</small><h2 class="h3">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Estimator</h2><p>Turn a footprint into real roof squares with pitch and waste, then compare against the carrier’s roof section.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/utah-claim-calculators/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><span class="tool-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/brick-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/brick-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/brick-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tool-ic">%</span></span><span class="tool-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2 class="h3">Percentage Deductible Calculator</h2><p>Convert an earthquake, wind or hail percentage deductible into dollars and see what a claim would actually pay.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/utah-claim-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/"><span class="tool-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-numbers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-numbers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-numbers.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tool-ic">◷</span></span><span class="tool-b"><small>Planner</small><h2 class="h3">Claim Timeline Planner</h2><p>Map notice, mitigation, proof-of-loss, holdback and suit dates from your date of loss, then export them to a calendar.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/utah-claim-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="tool-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/contractor.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/contractor-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/contractor.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="960" height="639" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tool-ic">✓</span></span><span class="tool-b"><small>Checklist</small><h2 class="h3">Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h2><p>Twelve yes/no questions that score your claim file and build a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="tool-card rv" href="/utah-claim-calculators/roof-snow-load-estimator/"><span class="tool-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-snow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-snow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-snow.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="768" height="512" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tool-ic">❄</span></span><span class="tool-b"><small>Estimator</small><h2 class="h3">Roof Snow Load Estimator</h2><p>Convert snow depth, snow type and ice into pounds per square foot and total roof weight for a winter claim.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-sand"><div class="shell split top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker dark">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the calculators together</h2><ol class="steps-list"><li><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/">Timeline planner</a>: map the deadlines first so nothing lapses.</li><li><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/roof-pitch-squares-estimator/">Roof pitch & squares</a>: check the roof measurements.</li><li><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/roof-snow-load-estimator/">Snow load estimator</a>: for winter roof and carport claims.</li><li><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/percentage-deductible-calculator/">Percentage deductible</a>: see what you’d actually receive, alongside the <a href="/utah-claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">holdback calculator</a>.</li><li><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">Gap &amp; fee estimator</a>: test whether appraisal pays after fees.</li><li><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">Readiness checkup</a>: finish with a file check.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="side-box side-call"><h2 class="side-t">Talk it through, free</h2><p>Send the carrier’s estimate or call. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal is worth it.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-accent btn-block" href="/contact-utah-appraiser/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
